Error [E0204]: `bucket.values` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> semantic_capture_events_drive_retention_and_deferred_clone_modes.jet:9:48
    |
  9 |     both(() -> { bucket.values = [3] }, bucket.values)
    |                                                ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&bucket.values`) only once, or copy first with `~bucket.values`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
